      "content": "survive the darkness? how do you even do that when the darkness is everywhere? it's not like i can just go to a park and feel better. even when i'm alone, i feel like i'm just waiting for the next bad thing to happen or the next person to tell me i don't matter. it feels like the only way to actually be at peace is to just not be part of this anymore. like, to just stop everything.",
